 unsigned nextClocks(const ControllerDeviceState&d,const ControllerInterruptRuntime&irq)const{if(bound_!=&d||!irq.boundTo(d)||!task_||d.interruptMode2||d.pendingIrqsHigh||irq.active()||(d.pendingIrqs&&irq.mask()==ControllerInterruptRuntime::Mask::Enabled))return 0;if(dsp_)return dsp_->nextClocks(d,irq);if(lcd_)return lcd_->nextClocks(d,irq);if(numeric_)return numeric_->nextClocks(d,irq,*numericLcd_);if(voices_)return voices_->nextClocks(d,irq,*voicesDsp_);if(voiceInit_)return voiceInit_->nextClocks(d,irq);auto cost=task_->nextClocks(d.lastWrite);return cost?cost+(d.pendingIrqs?1u:0u):0;}
 Result advanceBefore(ControllerDeviceState&d,ControllerInterruptRuntime&irq,unsigned available){if(bound_!=&d||!irq.boundTo(d))return {0,false,Block::NotBound};if(!task_)return {0,false,Block::Inactive};if(d.interruptMode2||d.pendingIrqsHigh)return {0,false,Block::UnsupportedMode};if(irq.active()||(d.pendingIrqs&&irq.mask()==ControllerInterruptRuntime::Mask::Enabled))return {0,false,Block::NeedsInterrupt};if(dsp_){auto r=dsp_->advanceBefore(d,irq,available);if(r.returned){dsp_=nullptr;if(!task_->resume(Service::DspWrite))return {r.clocks,false,Block::DspBusy};}return {r.clocks,false,r.blocked==ControllerDspTransferRuntime::Block::NeedsInterrupt?Block::NeedsInterrupt:Block::None};}if(lcd_){auto r=lcd_->advanceBefore(d,irq,available);if(r.returned){lcd_=nullptr;if(!task_->resume(lcdService_))return {r.clocks,false,Block::DspBusy};}return {r.clocks,false,r.blocked==ControllerLcdRuntime::Block::NeedsInterrupt?Block::NeedsInterrupt:Block::None};}if(numeric_){auto r=numeric_->advanceBefore(d,irq,*numericLcd_,available);if(r.returned){numeric_=nullptr;numericLcd_=nullptr;if(!task_->resume(Service::DisplayNumber))return {r.clocks,false,Block::DspBusy};}return {r.clocks,false,r.blocked==ControllerNumericDisplayRuntime::Block::NeedsInterrupt?Block::NeedsInterrupt:Block::None};}if(voices_){auto r=voices_->advanceBefore(d,irq,*voicesDsp_,available);if(r.returned){voices_=nullptr;voicesDsp_=nullptr;if(!task_->resume(Service::ReleaseSound))return {r.clocks,false,Block::DspBusy};}return {r.clocks,false,r.blocked==ControllerProgramVoicesRuntime::Block::NeedsInterrupt?Block::NeedsInterrupt:r.blocked==ControllerProgramVoicesRuntime::Block::DspBusy?Block::DspBusy:Block::None};}if(voiceInit_){auto r=voiceInit_->advanceBefore(d,irq,available);if(r.returned){voiceInit_=nullptr;if(!task_->resume(Service::InitializeVoice))return {r.clocks,false,Block::DspBusy};}return {r.clocks,false,r.blocked==ControllerProgramVoiceInitRuntime::Block::NeedsInterrupt?Block::NeedsInterrupt:Block::None};}if(task_->request().service!=Service::None)return {0,false,Block::AwaitService};auto cost=task_->nextClocks(d.lastWrite),arb=d.pendingIrqs?1u:0u;if(!cost||available<cost+arb)return {};if(arb)(void)d.read8(0xfffff2);auto begin=d.cycles;bool stack=task_->stackWrites();auto history=[](uint32_t a){a&=0xffffff;return a<0x400000||(a>=0xfffd10&&a<0xffffa0)?int(a):-1;};auto read=[&](uint32_t a,unsigned width,unsigned end){uint32_t value=0;unsigned total=width==4?((a<0x400000)?6:2):((a<0x400000)?3:1),first=width==4?total/2:total;for(unsigned i=0;i<width;++i){auto off=end-total+(i<2?first:total);d.cycles=begin+off;d.lastRead=history(a+i);value=(value<<8)|d.readResource(a+i);}return value;};auto write=[&](uint32_t a,uint32_t v,unsigned width,unsigned end){unsigned total=width==4?((a<0x400000)?6:2):((a<0x400000)?3:1),first=width==4?total/2:total;for(unsigned i=0;i<width;++i){auto off=end-total+(i<2?first:total);d.cycles=begin+off;d.lastWrite=history(a+i);d.writeResource(a+i,uint8_t(v>>(8*(width-i-1))));}};auto maskAction=task_->maskAction();if(task_->advanceBefore(cost,read,write,d.lastWrite)!=cost)return {};if(maskAction==ControllerFlashProgramTask::MaskAction::Save)savedMask_=irq.mask();else if(maskAction==ControllerFlashProgramTask::MaskAction::Disable)irq.setMask(ControllerInterruptRuntime::Mask::Disabled);else if(maskAction==ControllerFlashProgramTask::MaskAction::Restore)irq.setMask(savedMask_);d.cycles=begin+cost;d.lastRead=-1;if(stack)d.lastWrite=-1;if(task_->complete()){task_.reset();return {cost+arb,true,Block::None};}return {cost+arb,false,Block::None};}
